@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness;performance] saved-foliage-residency-compaction
FoliageResidencyBuilder MUST consume current certified saved source/prepared descriptions, never re-export
or regenerate them. The selected original LOD's exact classified rigid corner multiset, including slot,
normal, colour, all UVs and multiplicities, MUST control removal; original UVs MUST use the producer's
UV0 fallback to the receiving channel count. One carrier MUST own rigid geometry, with the complete original material table.
Mixed scenery MUST use one rigid LOD; standalone trees with distinct authored rigid source LODs MUST
retain that simplification chain and screen sizes rather than repeating full trunk detail at distance. Canopy LODs and shadow MUST preserve every remaining corner and winding.
Committed-corner equality MUST NOT substitute for canonical build/reduction/render and collision checks.
A failed cook, missing rigid corner, stale package or invalid source MUST stop registry publication.
For engine-reduced original LODs without stored descriptions, compaction MUST use
the same current ExportStaticMeshLOD readback as the certified source exporter,
without creating or committing source descriptions. Complete finite attributes,
material/role classification and exact rigid multiplicity checks MUST still run.
Original-to-prepared rigid keys MAY equate positive and negative numeric zero,
because source JSON transport loses zero's sign. Every finite nonzero float MUST
remain exact; this MUST NOT normalize emitted corners or their saved-output hashes.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] prepared-foliage-collision-ownership
Mixed scenery MUST retain exact rigid-only complex collision; a district/crown box is forbidden.
A standalone semantic tree/palm MAY use a finite positive authored radius/endpoints manifest converted
from metres to Unreal centimetres with Y reflection, or a bounded capsule from its classified lower
rigid trunk. An existing source simple shape alone MUST NOT certify trunk provenance. Bushes and
leaves MUST remain passable. Canopy/shadow copies MUST have no physics/navigation data except a no-rigid
tree canopy explicitly serving as its simple-trunk carrier, or an authored prop's declared separate
collision-only hull. A prop hull MUST match its committed source witness and actual original hard hull
reference; the original render mesh MUST NOT become its collider. An authored prop without that witness
MAY partition only affirmative structural material slots from its manifest, preserving every other
surface; it MUST refuse unknown structural ownership. Original/shared packages MUST remain unchanged.
A receiving native fixture MUST cover rigid-only mixed collision and nonblocking canopy/trunk separation.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] whole-textured-caldera-trunk
The exact committed four Caldera tree sources and their authored PropLOD paths MAY
receive the explicit simple-trunk capsule policy despite zero classified rigid faces.
Current source proof and unchanged declared fitted heights MUST precede dispatch.
The authored radius MUST be 40cm, local XY axis zero, and endpoints -15cm to 10% of
fitted height. Broad root/ground bounds MUST NOT determine collision. All certified
canopy corners and the existing exact native capsule physics checks MUST remain.
Other whole-textured sources MUST refuse without their own explicit trunk witness.
